{"id":"wb-7-1274","name":"潮州老城古民居建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"潮州老城古民居建筑群","text":"潮州老城古民居建筑群位于中华人民共和国广东省潮州市湘桥区南门十巷历史街区、许驸马府历史街区和旧西门街历史街区，共十四座古民居，分别为明代、清代、民国时期建筑遗存，是潮州民居建筑的典范和代表。原有部分民居已分别被列为潮州市文物保护单位和广东省文物保护单位，2013年被“打包”列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BD%AE%E5%B7%9E%E8%80%81%E5%9F%8E%E5%8F%A4%E6%B0%91%E5%B1%85%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":89385370,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89385370","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d305e54911889a03b206fd33.jpg","title":"20250930_Gucuo_Xiang_Lin_Zhai.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250930_Gucuo_Xiang_Lin_Zhai.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c0/20250930_Gucuo_Xiang_Lin_Zhai.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Gucuo Xiang Lin Zhai","width":320,"height":240}}